      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A prayer of Habakkuk the prophet upon Shigionoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I have heard thy speech,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was afraid: O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", revive thy work in the midst of the years, in the midst of the years make known; in wrath remember mercy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God came from Teman, and the Holy One from mount Paran. Selah. His glory covered the heavens, and the earth was full of his praise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brightness was as the light; he had horns",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "coming",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "out of his hand: and there",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the hiding of his power.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before him went the pestilence, and burning coals went forth at his feet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He stood, and measured the earth: he beheld, and drove asunder the nations; and the everlasting mountains were scattered, the perpetual hills did bow: his ways",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "everlasting.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I saw the tents of Cushan in affliction:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the curtains of the land of Midian did tremble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Was the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "displeased against the rivers?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thine anger against the rivers?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy wrath against the sea, that thou didst ride upon thine horses",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy chariots of salvation?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy bow was made quite naked,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "according",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the oaths of the tribes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even thy",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "word. Selah. Thou didst cleave the earth with rivers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The mountains saw thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they trembled: the overflowing of the water passed by: the deep uttered his voice,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lifted up his hands on high.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sun",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "moon stood still in their habitation: at the light of thine arrows they went,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at the shining of thy glittering spear.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou didst march through the land in indignation, thou didst thresh the heathen in anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou wentest forth for the salvation of thy people,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for salvation with thine anointed; thou woundedst the head out of the house of the wicked, by discovering the foundation unto the neck. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou didst strike through with his staves the head of his villages: they came out as a whirlwind to scatter me: their rejoicing",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAB.3.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAB.3.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as to devour the poor secretly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
